cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article.
title: "exomass: mass inference for exoplanets from catalogue observables"
abstract: >-
  A LightGBM regressor that predicts exoplanet masses from archive
  observables, with a physics cascade that fills derivable predictors so that
  only a planet radius is strictly required, and a catalogue of predicted
  masses for transiting planets and Kepler candidates.
